    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1012">

                <pb facs="0676" n="604" xml:id="pg604"/>

                <head>Editor of the Weisse Adler</head>
                <note rend="inline" rendition="#center" type="source">[Translation.]</note>
                <dateline>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Office of the Weisse Adler</hi>, <lb/>
                    <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Zurich</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                        when="1865-05-10">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">May</hi> 10, 1865</date>.</dateline>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editor of the Bund, Bern:</hi>
                </p>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Sir</hi>: Your invitation to join in the
                    address to the American people has been received. I willingly accede to it; but
                    as several private addresses have already been circulated here, it will be
                    impossible to obtain many more names.</p>
                <p>I enclose several subscription lists of the Polish emigrants in this part of the
                    country.</p>
                <p>Yours, respectfully,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILHELM HABICHT.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
